From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:08:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/39] Branding: Ibasho's name, window, About and login screen

- App name "Ibasho" (APP_NAME, CAPITALIZED_APP_NAME; translations fall back
  to English for these), so the window title, menus and About say Ibasho.
  SECOND_LIFE, the world's name, is unchanged.
- Executable IbashoViewer.exe, installer Ibasho_<version>_<arch>, Windows
  version resources and splash say Ibasho.
- Own window class, single-instance mutex, settings folder and cache
  folder ("Ibasho"), so it runs beside another viewer without sharing
  settings, logins or cache, and SLURLs and instance checks don't cross.
- About: credits Linden Lab's viewer as the base without implying they
  made Ibasho, says neither Linden Lab nor Ibasho provides support, drops
  credits for Havok, Kakadu and Vivox's codec (not in this build), and
  carries the artwork notice and trademark line.
- Login screen: the viewer's name and version under the controls
  (click for About).
